Add flight.max_duration_min filter

Time-of-day window alone allowed flights like 5J ICN-HKG via MNL
(1455 min = 24h15m) to pass and even rank first by cost despite the
brutal duration. Add an explicit cap (default 900 min = 15h) applied
in flight_in_window() so unreasonably long itineraries get filtered
before scoring.

